        <area aac="QLD_FA004" description="South Queensland" type="sub-region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-07T17:00:00+10:00" end-time-local="2026-11-12T00:00:00+10:00" start-time-utc="2026-11-07T07:00:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-11T14:00:00Z">
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough will cross the south Queensland waters on Sunday, followed by a weak ridge as a high crosses Tasmania. A low will form and deepen in the Tasman Sea on Sunday, before drifting southward towards New Zealand over the following few days. A fresh to strong south to southeasterly wind change will extend over the southeastern waters on Sunday in the wake of the trough.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
